        "widget": {
          "title": "Capacity Metrics",
          "text": {
            "content": "**Description:** ONTAP Metrics related to Node/Total Available Space/Total Logical Capacity/Total Provisioned Capacity etc.\n\n**Total Provisioned Capacity:** Total Provisioned Capacity accumulated at the cluster level. \n\nIt is the size in the bytes which has been grouped by cluster.\n\n**Total Logical Capacity:** Total Logical Capacity accumulated at the cluster level. \n\nIt is the size in the bytes which has been grouped by cluster.\n\n**Total Available Space:** Total Available Space accumulated at the cluster level.\n\nIt is the size in the bytes which has been grouped by cluster.",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
              "font_size": 4,
              "pointer_location": 0
            }
          },
          "id": ""
        },
        "x_pos": 0,
        "y_pos": 0
      },
      {
        "x_pos": 24,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "ONTAP Metrics",
          "text": {
            "content": "**Description:** ONTAP Metrics related to Node status. \n\n**Node Up Count:** Finding the number of the nodes which are UP. \n\nIt is the number of counts which has been grouped by region. \n\n**Node Fail Count:** Finding the number of the nodes which are in any other state other than UP. \n\nIt is the number of counts which has been grouped by region. ",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
